{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "architecture",
  "meta": {
    "title": "NestJS Module Composition — apps/api",
    "subtitle": "AppModule raiz + imports globais + DI bindings hexagonal (Users ↔ Audit ↔ Prisma)",
    "output": "http-api-nestjs-module-composition.architecture.html",
    "quality_profile": "standard",
    "animation": "trace",
    "visual_preset": "signal-flow",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "module-graph",
        "label": "Module graph",
        "focus": [
          "app_module",
          "config_module",
          "logger_module",
          "prisma_module",
          "audit_module",
          "health_module",
          "users_module",
          "prisma_persistence",
          "audit_persistence",
          "users_controller",
          "users_use_cases"
        ],
        "note": "Composição canônica: AppModule orquestra 5 sub-módulos com bindings DI de ports (USER_REPOSITORY_PORT, AUDIT_SERVICE_PORT)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "layout": {
    "mode": "grid",
    "origin": [40, 40],
    "cols": 4,
    "gapX": 24,
    "gapY": 24,
    "cellW": 220,
    "cellH": 96
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "app_module",
      "type": "external",
      "label": "AppModule",
      "sublabel": "@Module raiz",
      "tag": "apps/api/src/app.module.ts",
      "row": 0,
      "col": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "config_module",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "ConfigModule",
      "sublabel": "isGlobal + cache",
      "tag": "@nestjs/config",
      "row": 1,
      "col": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "logger_module",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "LoggerModule",
      "sublabel": "pino + pino-pretty",
      "tag": "nestjs-pino",
      "row": 1,
      "col": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "prisma_module",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "PrismaModule",
      "sublabel": "@Global()",
      "tag": "@prisma/client + PrismaService",
      "row": 1,
      "col": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "audit_module",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "AuditInfraModule",
      "sublabel": "AUDIT_SERVICE_PORT → Prisma",
      "tag": "apps/api/src/shared/audit",
      "row": 1,
      "col": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "health_module",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "HealthModule",
      "sublabel": "GET /api/v1/health",
      "tag": "apps/api/src/modules/health",
      "row": 2,
      "col": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "users_module",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "UsersModule",
      "sublabel": "bounded context Users",
      "tag": "apps/api/src/modules/users",
      "row": 2,
      "col": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "prisma_persistence",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "PrismaPersistModule",
      "sublabel": "USER_REPOSITORY_PORT → Prisma",
      "tag": "infrastructure/persistence",
      "row": 2,
      "col": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "audit_persistence",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "PrismaAuditService",
      "sublabel": "implements AuditServicePort",
      "tag": "prisma-audit.service.ts",
      "row": 2,
      "col": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "users_controller",
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "UsersController",
      "sublabel": "@Controller + Zod pipes",
      "tag": "infra/http/users.controller.ts",
      "row": 3,
      "col": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "users_use_cases",
      "type": "security",
      "label": "UserUseCases",
      "sublabel": "USER_USE_CASES (Symbol.for)",
      "tag": "application/user-use-cases.ts",
      "row": 3,
      "col": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "user_aggregate",
      "type": "security",
      "label": "User aggregate",
      "sublabel": "domain/User aggregate",
      "tag": "domain/user.aggregate.ts",
      "row": 3,
      "col": 3
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Composição canônica",
      "items": [
        "AppModule importa: Config, Logger, PrismaModule, AuditInfra, Health, Users",
        "PrismaModule é @Global() (auto-injetável em qualquer module)",
        "UsersModule importa PrismaPersistence (port binding) + AuditInfra",
        "DI por Symbol.for tokens (USER_REPOSITORY_PORT, AUDIT_SERVICE_PORT)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Hexagonal DI bindings",
      "items": [
        "Domain layer: define Port interfaces (UserRepositoryPort, AuditServicePort)",
        "Application layer: use cases recebem ports via @Inject(token)",
        "Infrastructure layer: implementações Prisma registradas em PrismaPersistenceModule/AuditInfraModule",
        "Sem @Inject explícito o container passaria undefined (latent bug, Task 7.7)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Logger + Config",
      "items": [
        "ConfigModule.forRoot({ isGlobal: true, cache: true })",
        "LoggerModule: pino-pretty em dev / redact paths em prod",
        "REDACT_PATHS = ['req.headers.authorization', 'req.headers.cookie']",
        "Pino logger propaga correlationId W3C do OpenTelemetry"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
